4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AXeymtkgXjsQ7kNvwGAgyp3&_nc_oc=Adpg76XguqAb6xOjhBSvvOdQngRVbE2UkCLGXMQGefkNyM_o0SF3NdG2bblMIKGcLzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFwnXcPsZSjyuNeEYIc832pzFrw1G6pp1ou8HlBnb-a6g&oe=6A86FB54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4m8A36FLg6MQ7kNvwGxt1eJ&_nc_oc=AdohLjBhARwhph_4Bk1TZGwkKvsu3uxe9WMYtTmapP42XZ-Pou-0mB7044dfggBTC7s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEicBjl2wEnxY0nQl6RHJw7sAMaAY4KhcoKILDApCA2sA&oe=6A870032"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1U5oZIuwaNYQ7kNvwFk2l9Q&_nc_oc=AdriH-MQZSNVTczurUIV7sUdcfJjZAHuk83NyLXt1okXeSrd1nw0q3_UZ8pk8LqBzqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFp6vOV-JxCSQqSNVVwLr-406n7UqBqptChrYl5LVBbIQ&oe=6A86D595"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p